ce cell\">35<small data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"currency unit label\">ج.م</small></span>\n<div class=\"pactions\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5\" data-name=\"product actions cell\">\n<button class=\"btn-view\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"view pharmacies button\" type=\"button\">عرض الصيدليات<i class=\"icon-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"left chevron icon\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn-add\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"add to cart button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-plus\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"plus icon\"></i>إضافة</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"prow\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"product row: Ebimol\">\n<div class=\"pname\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"product name cell\">\n<span class=\"tile\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"product icon tile\"><i class=\"icon-pill\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pill icon\"></i></span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"product name text group\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"product brand name\">أبيمول</b><em data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"product active ingredient\">باراسيتامول</em></div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"pmeta\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"product concentration cell\">500 مج · أقراص</span>\n<span class=\"pmeta\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3\" data-name=\"product packaging cell\">20 قرص</span>\n<span class=\"pprice num\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4\" data-name=\"product price cell\">28<small data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"currency unit label\">ج.م</small></span>\n<div class=\"pactions\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-5\" data-name=\"product actions cell\">\n<button class=\"btn-view\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"view pharmacies button\" type=\"button\">عرض الصيدليات<i class=\"icon-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"left chevron icon\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn-add\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"add to cart button\" type=\"butt