e=\"product name text group\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"product brand name\">بروفين</b><em data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"product active ingredient\">إيبوبروفين</em></div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"pmeta\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"product concentration cell\">400 مج · أقراص</span>\n<span class=\"pmeta\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-3\" data-name=\"product packaging cell\">عبوة أقراص</span>\n<span class=\"pprice num\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-4\" data-name=\"product price cell\">45<small data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-4-1\" data-name=\"currency unit label\">ج.م</small></span>\n<div class=\"pactions\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-5\" data-name=\"product actions cell\">\n<button class=\"btn-view\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-5-1\" data-name=\"view pharmacies button\" type=\"button\">عرض الصيدليات<i class=\"icon-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-5-1-1\" data-name=\"left chevron icon\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn-add\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-5-2\" data-name=\"add to cart button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-plus\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-5-5-2-1\" data-name=\"plus icon\"></i>إضافة</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"prow\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6\" data-name=\"product row: Zyrtec\">\n<div class=\"pname\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-1\" data-name=\"product name cell\">\n<span class=\"tile\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"product icon tile\"><i class=\"icon-pill\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pill icon\"></i></span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"product name text group\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"product brand name\">زيرتك</b><em data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"product active ingredient\">سيتريزين</em></div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"pmeta\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-2\" data-name=\"product concentration cell\">10 مج · أقراص</span>\n<span class=\"pmeta\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-3\" data-name=\"product packaging cell\">عبوة أقراص</span>\n<span class=\"pprice num\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-6-4\" data-name=\"product price cell\">55<