rice value\">35 ج.م</span>\n<span class=\"p-base\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"base price label\">السعر الأساسي</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"p-add\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"add to cart button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-plus\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"plus icon\"></i>إضافة للعربة</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"dialog tab navigation\">\n<button class=\"tab active\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"active pharmacies tab button\" type=\"button\">الصيدليات</button>\n<button class=\"tab\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"product info tab button\" type=\"button\">معلومات المنتج</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-toolbar\" data-kid=\"1-3-4\" data-name=\"pharmacy search toolbar\">\n<span class=\"p-area\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"current area indicator\"><i class=\"icon-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>الحي السابع، مدينة نصر</span>\n<button class=\"p-change\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"change area link button\" type=\"button\">تغيير المنطقة</button>\n<div class=\"sort\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-3\" data-name=\"sort toggle group\">\n<button class=\"active\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"active lowest price sort button\" type=\"button\">الأقل سعرًا</button>\n<button data-kid=\"1-3-4-3-2\" data-name=\"most stock sort button\" type=\"button\">الأكثر مخزونًا</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"offers\" data-kid=\"1-3-5\" data-name=\"pharmacy branch offers list\">\n<article class=\"offer\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"available pharmacy offer card\">\n<div class=\"o-name\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy name and details block\">\n<strong data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy branch name\">فرع دواك التجريبي - الحي السابع</strong>\n<span class=\"o-addr\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy address line\"><i class=\"icon-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>الحي السابع، مدينة نصر، القاهرة</span>\n<span class=\"o-stock\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-3\" data-name=\"available stock indicator\"><i class=\"icon-package\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"package box icon\"></i>8 علب متاحة</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-price\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2\" data-name=\"offer price and delivery block\">\n<strong data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"offer price value\">37 ج.م</strong>\n<span class=\"o-delivery\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"delivery info line\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"delivery cost item\"><i class=\"icon-truck\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"truck icon\"></i>توصيل 30 ج.م</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"delivery time item\"><i class=\"icon-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>90 دقيقة</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"o-action\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-3\" data-name=\"order now button\" type=\"button\">اطلب الآن</button>\n</article>\n<article class=\"offer\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2\" data-name=\"available pharmacy offer card\">\n<div class=\"o-name\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy name and details block\">\n<strong data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy branch name\">فرع دواك التجريبي - الحي السابع ٢</strong>\n<span class=\"o-addr\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy address line\"><i class=\"icon-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>الحي السابع، مدينة نصر، القاهرة</span>\n<span class=\"o-stock\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1-3\" data-name=\"available stock indicator\"><i class=\"icon-package\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"package box icon\"></i>5 علب متاحة</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-price\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2\" data-name=\"offer price and delivery block\">\n<strong data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"offer price value\">34 ج.م</strong>\n<span class=\"o-delivery\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"delivery info line\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"delivery cost item\"><i class=\"icon-truck\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"truck icon\"></i>توصيل 30 ج.م</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"delivery time item\"><i class=\"icon-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>90 دقيقة</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"o-action\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-3\" data-name=\"order now button\" type=\"button\">اطلب الآن</button>\n</article>\n<article class=\"offer out\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3\" data-name=\"out-of-stock pharmacy offer card\">\n<div class=\"o-name\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy name and details block\">\n<strong data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy branch name\">فرع دواك التجريبي - الحي السابع ٣</strong>\n<span class=\"o-addr\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy address line\"><i class=\"icon-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>الحي السابع، مدينة نصر، القاهرة</span>\n<span class=\"o-stock out\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1-3\" data-name=\"out-of-stock indicator\"><i class=\"icon-alert-circle\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"alert circle icon\"></i>غير متوفر</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o-price\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2\" data-name=\"offer price and delivery block\">\n<strong class=\"out\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2-1\" data-name=\"offer price value (struck out)\">39 ج.م</strong>\n<span class=\"o-delivery\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2-2\" data-name=\"delivery info line\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"delivery cost item\"><i class=\"icon-truck\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"truck icon\"></i>توصيل 30 ج.م</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"delivery time item\"><i class=\"icon-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>90 دقيقة</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"o-action\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-3\" data-name=\"disabled unavailable order button\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">غير متوفر</button>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-foot\" data-kid=\"1-3-6\" data-name=\"dialog footer\">\n<button class=\"more-branches\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1\" data-name=\"view more locations button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>3 فروع في مناطق أخرى</button>\n<span class=\"p-demo\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-2\" data-name=\"demo data disclaimer label\">أسعار وفروع تجريبية</span>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>",
