ta-kid=\"1-1-7-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"currency unit label\">ج.م</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"deliv\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-5\" data-name=\"delivery fee and time cell\"><p class=\"a\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-5-1\" data-name=\"delivery fee text\">30 ج.م توصيل</p><p class=\"b\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-5-2\" data-name=\"delivery time text\">90 دقيقة</p><span class=\"demo\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-5-3\" data-name=\"demo badge tag\">تجريبي</span></div>\n<div class=\"act\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-6\" data-name=\"row action buttons stack\"><button class=\"primary\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-6-1\" data-name=\"order now primary button\">اطلب الآن</button><button class=\"ghost\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-2-6-2\" data-name=\"add to cart ghost button\">أضف للعربة</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3\" data-name=\"branch row in local area (second)\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1\" data-name=\"branch name and area cell\">\n<p class=\"ph-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1-1\" data-name=\"branch name title\">فرع دواك التجريبي – الحي السابع</p>\n<p class=\"ph-area\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1-2\" data-name=\"branch area with pin icon\"><i class=\"ico icon-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>الحي السابع، مدينة نصر</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2\" data-name=\"stock cell\"><p class=\"cell-strong\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2-1\" data-name=\"stock quantity\">8 علب</p><p class=\"cell-sub\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-2-2\" data-name=\"availability status tag\">متوفر</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-3\" data-name=\"distance cell\"><p class=\"cell-strong\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-3-1\" data-name=\"distance value\">2.4 كم</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-4\" data-name=\"price cell\"><p class=\"price-cell\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-4-1\" data-name=\"price with currency\">37 <span data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"currency unit label\">ج.م</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"deliv\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-5\" data-name=\"delivery fee and time cell\"><p class=\"a\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-5-1\" data-name=\"delivery fee text\">30 ج.م توصيل</p><p class=\"b\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-5-2\" data-name=\"delivery time text\">90 دقيقة</p><span class=\"demo\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-5-3\" data-name=\"demo badge tag\">تجريبي</span></div>\n<div class=\"act\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-6\" data-name=\"row action buttons stack\"><button class=\"primary\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-6-1\" data-name=\"order now primary button\">اطلب الآن</button><button class=\"ghost\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-3-6-2\" data-name=\"add to cart ghost button\">أضف للعربة</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"group\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4\" data-name=\"out-of-stock group header\"><i class=\"ico icon-chevron-up\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron up icon\"></i><span data-kid=\"1-1-7-4-2\" data-name=\"out-of-stock group title\">فرع واحد غير متوفر في منطقتك</span></div>\n<div class=\"row off\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5\" data-name=\"out-of-stock branch row\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-1\" data-name=\"branch name and area cell\">\n<p class=\"ph-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-1-1\" data-name=\"branch name title\">فرع دواك التجريبي – الحي السابع ٣</p>\n<p class=\"ph-area\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-1-2\" data-name=\"branch area with pin icon\"><i class=\"ico icon-map-pin\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>الحي السابع، مدينة نصر</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-2\" data-name=\"stock cell (out of stock)\"><p class=\"cell-strong stock-off\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-2-1\" data-name=\"out of stock label\">غير متوفر</p><p class=\"cell-sub\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-2-2\" data-name=\"zero quantity subtext\">0 عبوة</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-3\" data-name=\"distance cell\"><p class=\"cell-strong\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-3-1\" data-name=\"distance value\">3.1 كم</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-4\" data-name=\"price cell\"><p class=\"price-cell\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-4-1\" data-name=\"price with currency\">39 <span data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-4-1-1\" data-name=\"currency unit label\">ج.م</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"deliv\" data-kid=\"1-1-7-5-5\" data-name=\"de